{title: Mar Bhi Gaya Toh Bhi Tujhe}
{artist: Himesh Reshammiya Sawai Bhatt}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#]Meri taqdeer ka aina,        [C#]Tujhse hi ae mere humsafar
[C#]Rabb se hai yeh guzarish meri,        [C#]Tujhko lag jaye meri umaar
[C#]Jab tak sanseinn chaalengi,        [C#]Tujh ko chahunga yaar
[C#]Maar bhi gaya,        [B]toh bhi tujhe
[A]Karunga main [C#]pyaar,        [C#]Maar bhi gaya
[B]toh bhi tujhe,        [A]Karunga main [C#]pyaar
[C#]Tujhse laagi hai aise lagan,        [C#]Birha mein jal rha hai yeh mann
[C#]Main adhura hoon tere bina,        [C#]Jaise dil ke bina dhadkan
[C#]Jab tak sanseinn chaalengi,        [C#]Tujh ko chahunga yaar
[C#]Maar bhi gaya,        [B]toh bhi tujhe
[A]Karunga main [C#]pyaar,        [C#]Maar bhi gaya
[B]toh bhi tujhe,        [A]Karunga main [C#]pyaar
